flowchart TD
    I[Request + context + history + catalog] --> P[Planner: next step]
    P -->|next=caller and short instruction| C[Caller: tool name and complete arguments]
    C --> V[env.validate]
    V -->|valid| T[env.call]
    T -->|success: actual observation| P
    P -->|next=done| S[Stop]
    P -->|next=give_up| S
    V -->|invalid| S
    T -->|failure or done=false| S
    T -->|sys.ask_missing_info| S
